Patch 2005: new fragment programs of one batch are built on worker threads.

The title screen walks through thousands of distinct fragment programs; each new one cost about 27 ms in render_frame (HLSL
compile and pipeline creation). A batch now collects its new programs, builds them in parallel and joins before drawing.
FP_PAR_COMPILE=0 builds on the render thread as before.

